  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that multimodal models with multiprofile settings and scvi_n200 RNA encoder (config_030) achieve high accuracy (0.6315). This experiment tests whether using the more powerful imagenet_vit_l image encoder with weighted fusion (instead of concat) improves performance, clarifying the impact of image encoder choice and fusion method. It balances exploitation of the scvi_n200 RNA encoder (a strong performer) with exploration of image encoder and fusion variations, which are critical design choices with uncertain optimal configurations."
